\id JHN King James Version excerpt (public domain)
\h John
\c 3
\p
\v 16 \wj For God so loved the world, that he gave his only begotten Son, that whosoever believeth in him should not perish, but have everlasting life.\wj*
\v 17 \wj For God sent not his Son into the world to condemn the world; but that the world through him might be saved.\wj*\x - \xo 3.17 \xt Luke 9.56\x*
\v 18 \wj He that believeth on him is not condemned: but he that believeth not is condemned already, because he hath not believed in the name of the only begotten Son of God.\wj*
